[l_english.modifier_production_speed_trade_complex_factor]
§YTrade Center§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_trade_complex_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Trade Center construction.

[l_english.trade_complex]
Trade Center

[l_english.trade_complex_desc]
This building allows you to trade resources. The higher the level and the more Trade Centers you have, the higher the resource exchange limit. (Trade Center-related resolutions will be refreshed within 7 days after construction is completed)

$PIHC_TRADE_COMPLEX_TOOLTIP$

[l_english.trade_complex_plural]
Trade Centers

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_trade_complex_factor]
§Y贸易中心§!建造速度

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_trade_complex_factor_desc]
改变贸易中心的建造速度。

[l_simp_chinese.trade_complex]
贸易中心

[l_simp_chinese.trade_complex_desc]
此建筑允许你对资源进行贸易置换，越高等级、越多数量的贸易中心，置换的资源数量上限越高。（贸易中心相关决议将在建造完成后一个星期内刷新）

$PIHC_TRADE_COMPLEX_TOOLTIP$

